  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative and Financial Health Check</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the proposed work is to perform a Administrative and Financial health check of Hutukara&apos;s systems in place. Covering CAFOD&apos;s grants from 2015-2016 and the Evan Cornish foundation&apos;s fund of &#xa3;9,989.00 sent to HAY in March 2013.

There will be two final products: a) a diagnose of financial and administration systems in place with recommendations where necessary and  b) Five spreadsheets with an analysis with each of the projects&apos; financial statement, confirming the initial balance, the funds received, financial income or other income, the aggregation of expenditure, the balance at the end of the project.

This consultancy is needed to abide by CAFOD&apos;s audit requirements and will serve as a capacity building exercise.</narrative>
  </description>
